The library is Lean 4 (the `VbmSimd` modules import `Init` only) plus one small C header (`include/vbm_simd.h`); it bundles no third-party code.
The build uses the Lean 4 toolchain (Apache-2.0), pinned in `mise.toml`, which `mise` downloads; the proofs use only Lean's own libraries.
